  "history": [
    {
      "id": "88eb1cae-29d9-487f-9abe-049efd9f2d29",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "mara",
      "text": [
        "一位穿亚麻衬衣的女士抬手招呼。她晃了晃钥匙：“你就是来住一夏的新房客吧？我是玛拉。先放下行李，别急着认全镇的人。”",
        "A woman in a linen shirt waves a key. “You must be my summer tenant. I’m Mara. Let’s put your bag down before you try to learn the whole town.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1e8a1a5b-2037-4b66-8700-21a878f6729e",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "mara",
      "text": [
        "“楼上的小房间是你的。先去放下包，回来再说别的。”她把钥匙放进你手里。",
        "“The little room is yours. Put your bag down first. Everything else can wait.” She places the key in your hand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "85ead061-6081-484d-9279-a87e3f7d2481",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到你的租屋。",
        "You arrive at Your Room."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4cbb3513-bf1f-450c-b59c-ebd60413725b",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "行李放到了床边。窗外有杯碟碰响。房间是你的了——可以去看看小镇。",
        "Your bag rests beside the bed. Cups clink somewhere outside. The room is yours. Time to see a little of town."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dce2cdfa-3991-4856-9fb9-22998cfb3034",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到车站街。",
        "You arrive at Station Street."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "33955524-939e-4310-a7e3-2db12be60d60",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "mara",
      "text": [
        "“想认识人就去咖啡馆，想清静就沿海走。咖啡馆替我保管着工具袋，路过时替我带回来就好。”",
        "“The café for company, the coast for quiet. The café is keeping my tool bag. Bring it back if you pass that way.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b11975ea-076d-4960-b3e8-0dd89b687e20",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到潮间咖啡馆。",
        "You arrive at Tide & Table."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "db53d23b-4db0-431d-8cf1-8c75b0d0427d",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "theo",
      "text": [
        "柜台后的年轻人把杯子放下，围裙上写着Theo。“叫我西奥。你刚到？玛拉把她的工具袋忘在这里了。”",
        "The man behind the counter sets down a cup. His apron reads Theo. “Just arrived? Mara left her tool bag here. You’re welcome to sit a while.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1ddbbb5c-8ace-439e-9488-1438274c2e92",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "theo",
      "text": [
        "“就在这里。”他把帆布袋递给你。“别急着走，那盏露台灯送进来检修，可一直没时间弄。”",
        "“Right here.” He hands you a canvas bag. “No rush. The terrace lantern came in for repairs, but I haven’t had time to look at it.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ae5477dd-dd2e-466f-b8dd-b09d7f142bde",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "准备好了就开始，也可以随时退出。",
        "Start when you’re ready. You can leave at any time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6373eb2e-ef77-4535-b133-c32e3b0fca83",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "灯亮了。西奥把一杯咖啡放在你面前，冲你举起杯子。",
        "The lantern lights up. Theo sets a coffee down for you and raises his own cup."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ed8b0c74-6ebe-435b-8808-00f4a5e4d914",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到车站街。",
        "You arrive at Station Street."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d6a27483-b4c7-4492-b5aa-2e504da7efda",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "mara",
      "text": [
        "她拉开袋子，松了口气：“正要用呢。谢谢。往后你不必事事问我，这个夏天是你的。”",
        "She opens the bag with relief. “Just what I needed. Thank you. You don’t need my permission for every outing. This summer is yours.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d978839b-633e-4144-a767-168e9b5c4c0c",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到旧街。",
        "You arrive at Market Lane."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9fbcef93-a157-4960-a43d-f79cba90bf75",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到集市广场。",
        "You arrive at Market Square."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b7808b77-937c-4e77-84d5-ffe3dcee45a6",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "告示说夏日集市缺少通往海边的安全路线。桥坏了，私人庭院也不能默认借道。你决定先去看看。",
        "The notice says the summer market needs safe access to the coast. The bridge is damaged, and the private garden isn’t a public shortcut. Worth a look."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "46bdbde5-5c22-487f-bbaa-0142d7fc7b40",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到旧街。",
        "You arrive at Market Lane."
      ]
    },
    {
