      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到山坡。",
        "You arrive at The Hill."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0328aaa4-cc07-45ed-850d-641e52d03411",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到海岸。",
        "You arrive at The Coast."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "000cdfc8-ea7f-4e77-86f3-6d53f41b80a9",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到滨海道。",
        "You arrive at Coastal Path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b7e51355-6eb9-4bcc-a8ea-e7433f91fdb6",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "两块桥板断了，下面的支撑还很牢。可以修，也可以找别的路。",
        "Two boards have split. The supports below are sound. You could repair it—or find another route."
      ]
    },
    {
