        "You arrive at The Lighthouse."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f5c64f1e-e8c4-40fb-a25a-9e3fb1a1dbbe",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "入口清楚写下上午十点到十二点的借道时间。庭院的边界保留着。",
        "The entrance clearly states the agreed hours: ten until noon. The garden remains a home."
      ]
    },
